// Title: Uncommon FileSystem Load Attempt By Format.com
// Rule ID: 9fb6b26e-7f9e-4517-a48b-8cac4a1b6c60
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
